    Bug 1932267 - Account Hub install add-on for exchange config. r=aleca, john.bieling

    **How to Test**
    - Update `mailnews.auto_config.addons_url` value to "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vDeo/ah-addons-test/main/addons.json"
    - Open account hub and use the email testaccounts@o365.thunderbird.net, skipping the auth modal
    - Select the exchange add-on option
    - The continue button should be disbabled. Click the install link in the config data
    - Account hub should begin installing with a notification saying "Downloading and installing add-on…"
    - The add-on should install with a notification saying "Successfully installed the add-on"
    - The install-addon text in the config data should go away and the continue button should be enabled
    - Closing and reopening the account hub with with the same email should also no longer show the install-addon text when selecting the exchange add-on option, and the continue button should still be enabled

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D235568

